Package: metrosp
Type: Package
Title: 'São Paulo' Metro Passenger Demand Data
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Vinicius", "Oike",
      email = "viniciusoike@gmail.com",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: Passenger demand data for the 'São Paulo' metro system, covering
    2017 to 2025. Provides monthly passenger entries and transported counts
    by line, average weekday station entries, daily station entries, and
    spatial geometries for metro and commuter train lines and stations.
    Data sourced from the METRO SP transparency portal
    <https://transparencia.metrosp.com.br/dataset/demanda> and 'GeoSampa'
    <https://geosampa.prefeitura.sp.gov.br/>.
